+	  FPC1020/FPC1022 fingerprint sensor.  The sensor itself is driven
+	  from a trusted execution environment application; this driver only
+	  exposes the platform resources through the legacy FPC sysfs ABI.
+
+	  This is needed for the LG V30 (joan), whose prebuilt fingerprint
+	  HAL expects /sys/devices/virtual/input/lge_fingerprint.
+
+	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will
+	  be called fpc1020_platform.
